# Everything under labs/ is deliberately vulnerable teaching material.
#
# Each target reproduces a specific bug class so learners can find and exploit
# it — missing URL validation, unsanitised SQL, unchecked buffers, disabled TLS
# verification. The flaws are the lesson, not defects to repair. "Fixing" them
# silently deletes the exercise, so scanner findings here are expected and a
# hardening patch against these files will be declined.
#
# The labs run only inside their own docker-compose networks (labs/start_lab.sh)
# and are never deployed. Nothing in labs/ ships to production.
